1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,742
Why?

2
00:00:00,742 --> 00:00:01,927
Look at one tube.

3
00:00:01,927 --> 00:00:07,877
The liquid touches the glass all the way round a circle of length two pi r.

4
00:00:07,877 --> 00:00:15,885
Along that line, surface tension pulls along the liquid surface, at the angle of contact theta to the wall.

5
00:00:15,885 --> 00:00:21,041
Its vertical part, T cos theta per unit length, lifts the liquid.

6
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:24,895
The upward force is two pi r T cos theta.

